crypto: add an optional LZ4KD page compressor for arm64 GKI

Target: ztc1997/android_gki_kernel_5.10_common at 6596b957a660.
Codec source: Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd., as published in
SukiSU-Nova/SukiSU_patch at 4ee085a39e3c95e44c9cac7af040e83bf926e6fa
(other/zram/lz4k/lib/lz4kd). Original copyright notices are retained.

Register the 4 KiB page codec via the existing legacy Crypto API.
The codec is compiled by the arm64 GKI defconfig. Selecting the
algorithm at runtime remains a separate step. Full-size results
are raw pages and use the existing ZRAM uncompressed-page path.

Validation: patch applicability and whitespace checked against
the pinned target source. Kernel compilation and device testing
are pending.

